<title>GERMANY: BUND FUTURES END HIGHER, FOCUS ON REPO.</title>
<headline>BUND FUTURES END HIGHER, FOCUS ON REPO.</headline>
<text>
<p>1535 GMT - Bund futures end solidly higher, boosted by mark, U.S. Treasuries. Focus on Tuesday's repo, but no change in Buba policy seen. Some fear down trend to resume.</p>
<p>* 6.00% July 2007 Bund 102.21, yld 5.69 pct bid (101.93)</p>
<p>* Sept Bund future 101.93 (101.60),range so far 102.01-101.52</p>
